  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small ball is tied to the end of a rope and is made to move in a horizontal circle of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. The angle between the rope and the vertical is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the linear speed of the ball?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{gR}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{gRtan\\alpha}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{gRsin\\alpha}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{gRcos\\alpha}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
